{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mummy-the-curse/469529-past-utterances-and-cosmic","id":469529,"title":"Past Utterances and 'Cosmic'","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Mummy: The Curse"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-04-05T12:42:20-07:00","id":469529,"title":"Past Utterances and 'Cosmic'","content":"Any idea what previously published Utterances, if any, may benefit from the 'Cosmic' keyword?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/665-shkspr1048","name":"shkspr1048","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"630"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-06T12:10:22-07:00","id":470303,"title":"","content":"Well the prophesy/summon meteor one fits the &quot;space-time&quot; fuckery of the Cosmic keyword, however I'm reluctant to open the meteor effect to Apotheosis-achieved Mummies, as it's kind of thematic that they don't wield the <i><b>visible</b></i> &quot;big guns&quot;. So I'd give the limited access to the &quot;Pull a secret from Fate&quot; power of Secrets Stripped from Skies, given sufficient Ren and Memory, without the ability to call down meteors.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-06T15:06:14-07:00","id":470401,"title":"","content":"I'd like to think that 'Rebuke the Vizier' would be both sufficiently defensive and low-key in nature to apply, but it does go light on the space-time angle...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/665-shkspr1048","name":"shkspr1048","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"630"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-06T18:22:14-07:00","id":470563,"title":"","content":"Cosmic is an interesting keyword because oftentimes the effects and theme of Utterances is that they're pretty cosmic to begin with. They're secrets ripped from time and stolen from the Shan'iatu.<br /> <br /> So for one to warrant a keyword saying that this one is <i>extra</i> cosmic implies a lot. Fittingly, the one we did get had to do with time travel which is admittedly on a whole different level than summoning a meteor by reaching back in time to justify it coming when you summon it, despite the latter's implications of time travel","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/638-reseru","name":"reseru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar638_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1574"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}